### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@contentType = application/json

### =====================
### Health Check
### =====================

GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### =====================
### Categories (Public)
### =====================

### Get all categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### Get category by ID (replace with actual ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### =====================
### Categories (Auth Required) - Will fail without token
### =====================

### Create category (should return 401 without auth)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "name": "Test Category",
    "description": "Test description"
}

### =====================
### Tags (Public)
### =====================

### Get all tags
GET {{baseUrl}}/tags

### =====================
### Courses (Public)
### =====================

### Get all courses
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses

### Get all courses with filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses?page=1&page_size=10&level=beginner

### Get course by ID (replace with actual ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### =====================
### Courses (Auth Required)
### =====================

### Create course (should return 401 without auth)
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "title": "Test Course",
    "description": "Test course description",
    "level": "beginner"
}

### =====================
### Validation Test - Should return validation errors
### =====================

### Create category with empty name (validation test)
# Need auth token for this to test validation
# POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
# Content-Type: {{contentType}}
# Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN
#
# {
#     "name": ""
# }

